2026-07-27T12:20:43.8894322Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:20:43.8894988Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:20:43.8895584Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:20:43.8896456Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:20:43.8897528Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
